{"chunk":"the use of interim zoning measures to protect the integrity of an area pending completion\n                  of a comprehensive planning study and preparation of a rezoning proposal is a commonly\n                  used technique around the country. Therefore, under the authority of Chapter 665 of the Acts of 1956 and Chapter 652\n               of the Acts of 1960 this article is established.","document":"ARTICLE_27_-_INTERIM_PLANNING_OVERLAY_DISTRICT","city":"boston","heading_1":"ARTICLE 27 INTERIM PLANNING OVERLAY DISTRICT","heading_2":"Section 27-1. Statement of Purpose.","url":"https:\/\/library.municode.com\/MA\/Boston\/codes\/Redevelopment_Authority?nodeId=ART27INPLOVDI_S27-1STPU","district_code":[],"district_category":[],"embedding":[0.0268047117,-0.0263518803,0.0385982171,0.024257401,-0.044401966,-0.0182471853,0.0251281075,-0.0034116656,-0.0032370002,0.0221835077,0.0837098286,0.0319155492,0.0113851996,-0.0286531132,0.0012789394,0.0046558473,0.0250321571,0.0099459402,0.0041207615,-0.0070467955,0.0275557693,-0.0008706426,0.0108073791,-0.1208581477,0.0206244458,-0.0034186207,0.0167211499,-0.0633563995,0.0091662118,-0.0080095427,0.0377494246,0.0268209223,0.0075735082,-0.0187967643,0.0319026709,-0.010802947,0.0022533697,-0.0482898839,0.0241075028,-0.0681544989,0.0068936357,0.0218143184,-0.05483374,-0.0215233862,-0.0206887554,-0.0293065179,0.024383029,0.0560912378,-0.0328417383,-0.0090812817,0.0418588668,0.0243747067,-0.0646526366,0.0696572885,-0.0258280002,-0.0488736965,-0.0415732041,0.0177813452,0.0409584269,-0.0154201174,0.0621760488,0.0107161179,-0.0720782727,0.0302336439,0.0217411909,0.0047055613,-0.0011236636,-0.0844512209,-0.0344034061,-0.0185664613,-0.0358899273,0.089163512,-0.0454815924,0.0076396898,0.0214892309,-0.0143312113,0.0264672134,0.0130792456,0.0147127667,0.042682372,-0.021630479,0.0499685891,-0.0478486679,0.0385602564,0.0560562909,-0.0653932542,0.0209773164,-0.0176111721,-0.040471863,-0.0300708171,0.0904594809,0.0258325785,-0.04474562